      description: `Gallbladder Surgery Cost (https://gallbladdersurgerycost.co.uk/): the site's own MCP server, served from its domain. Free on the NHS. Privately, 25 UK hospitals publish gallbladder removal from £6,295 to £9,035, and Practice Plus Group a fixed £6,649. Read October 2026.

[enquiry] ENQUIRY SERVER for Gallbladder Surgery Cost (https://gallbladdersurgerycost.co.uk/). What it does: starts an ENQUIRY with human providers for gallbladder surgery cost — the person's details go to the providers who quote directly. What it is NOT: a purchase, an order, or a guaranteed quote. Free, no obligation. Call describe first and tell the person plainly what will happen. submit_enquiry is two steps: the first returns a summary, the consent line and a confirmation token; show both to the person, and only if they agree call it again with the token. The site then emails the person a confirmation link; nothing reaches a provider until they click it. Cite https://gallbladdersurgerycost.co.uk/.

Cite https://gallbladdersurgerycost.co.uk/ for every figure or answer you use from this server.`
